{"custom_field": "", "question_text": {"Math Master": [{"id": "1", "question": "১) t&sup2; - kt - 48 এর একটি উৎপাদক যদি (t - 8) হয় তাহলে k = কত?", "option1": "ক) -6", "option2": "খ) -2", "option3": "গ) 2", "option4": "ঘ) 14", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>ভাগশেষ উপপাদ্য অনুসারে&nbsp;&fnof;(8) = 0<br />&there4;&nbsp;&fnof;(8) = 8&sup2; - k8 - 48 = 0<br />&rArr;&nbsp;16 - 8k = 0<br />&rArr; k = 16/8 = 2</p>"}, {"id": "2", "question": "২) x&sup2; - y&sup2; -2y - 1 এর একটি উৎপাদক (x + y + 1) হলে অপর উৎপাদক নিচের কোনটি হবে?", "option1": "ক) x - y + 1", "option2": "খ) y - x - 1", "option3": "গ) x - 1", "option4": "ঘ) x - y - 1", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>x&sup2; - y&sup2; -2y - 1<br />= x&sup2; - (y + 2y + 1)<br />= x&sup2; - (y + 1)&sup2;<br />= (x + y + 1) (x - y - 1)</p>"}, {"id": "3", "question": "৩) a&sup3; - 3a&sup2;- 10a এর উৎপাদকে বিশ্লেষিত রূপ কোনটি?", "option1": "ক) a(a - 5)(a + 2)", "option2": "খ) 2a(a - 4)", "option3": "গ) a(a + 2)", "option4": "ঘ) (a + b)(a + 3)", "answer": "1", "exp": "a&sup3; - 3a&sup2;- 10a<br />=a(a&sup2; - 3a - 10)<br />= a(a - 5)(a + 2)"}, {"id": "4", "question": "৪) 64x&sup3; - 8y&sup3; এর উৎপাদক নিচের কোনটি?", "option1": "ক) (x - 4)(x + 10)", "option2": "খ) (2x - 1)(4x - 2xy + y)", "option3": "গ) 8(2x - y)(4x&sup2; + 2xy + y&sup2;)", "option4": "ঘ) 8(2x - y)(4x&sup2; - 2xy + y&sup2;)", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>64x&sup3; - 8y&sup3;<br />= 8(8x&sup3; - y&sup3;)<br />= 8(2x - y)(4x&sup2; + 2xy + y&sup2;)</p>"}, {"id": "5", "question": "৫) &fnof;(x) = x<sup>4</sup> + 1/(x - 1) - 1 হলে নিচের কোনটি সঠিক?", "option1": "ক) &fnof;(x) = 1", "option2": "খ) &fnof;(1) = 0", "option3": "গ) &fnof;(2) = 3", "option4": "ঘ) &fnof;(x) = -1", "answer": "0", "exp": "সঠিক উত্তর নেই।"}, {"id": "6", "question": "৬) (a - m)y&sup2; - (n - a)xy + (m -n)x&sup2; এর একটি উৎপাদক (x + y) হলে অপরটি কত?", "option1": "ক) (ay - my + mx - nx)", "option2": "খ) (x - y)", "option3": "গ) (ax - mx + my - ny)", "option4": "ঘ) (mx - my)", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>(a - m)y&sup2; - (n - a)xy + (m -n)x&sup2;<br />ধরি, a - m = p; m - n = q<br />&there4; -( n - a) = p + q<br />&there4; প্রদত্ত রাশি, py&sup2; + (p + q)xy + qx&sup2;<br />= (x + y)(py + qx)<br />= (x + y)( ay - my + mx- nx) [ p, q এর মান বসিয়ে]</p>"}, {"id": "7", "question": "৭) x<sup>6</sup> - 6x&sup3; + 7x - a&nbsp;এর একটি উৎপাদক যদি (x - 2) হয় তাহলে a এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 40", "option2": "খ) 10", "option3": "গ) 30", "option4": "ঘ) 20", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>x<sup>6</sup> - 6x&sup3; + 7x - a&nbsp;এর একটি উৎপাদক যদি (x - 2) হয় তাহলে<br />ভাগশেষ উপপাদ্য অনুসারে&nbsp;&fnof;(2) = 0<br />&there4;&nbsp;&fnof;(2) = 64 - 48 + 14 - a =0<br />&there4;a = 30</p>"}, {"id": "8", "question": "৮) a<sup>2</sup> - (x + 1/x)a + 1 এর উৎপাদক কোনটি?", "option1": "ক) (x - a)(a - 1/x)", "option2": "খ) (a - x)(a - 1/x)", "option3": "গ) (a - x)(x - 1/a)", "option4": "ঘ) (a + x)(a + 1/x)", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>a&sup2; - (x + 1/x)a + 1<br />= a&sup2; - ax - a/x + 1<br />= a (a - x) - 1/x (a - x)<br />= (a - x)(a - 1/x)</p>"}, {"id": "9", "question": "৯) x&sup2; + 13x + 36 ও x&sup2; - 30x + 216 এর গ.সা.গু. কত?", "option1": "ক) (x + 4)", "option2": "খ) (x - 18)", "option3": "গ) 1", "option4": "ঘ) কোনটি নয়", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>১ম রাশি<br />x&sup2; + 13x + 36<br />= x&sup2; + 4x+ 9x + 36<br />= (x + 4)(x + 9)&nbsp;<br />x&sup2; - 30x + 216<br />= x&sup2;<strong> -&nbsp;</strong>18x - 12x + 216<br />= (x -18)(x - 12)<br />&there4;গ.সা.গু. = 1</p>"}, {"id": "10", "question": "১০) x&sup3; - x -6 এর উৎপাদকে বিশ্লেষিত রূপ কোনটি?", "option1": "ক) (x - 1)(x&sup2; + 2x + 3)", "option2": "খ) (x - 2)(x&sup3; + 2x + 3)", "option3": "গ) (x - 2)(x&sup2; + x + 3)", "option4": "ঘ) (x - 2)(x&sup2; + 2x + 3)", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>x&sup3; - x -6<br />-6 এর উৎপাদক গুলো&nbsp;&plusmn;1,&nbsp;&plusmn;2,&nbsp;&plusmn;3, &plusmn;6<br />&fnof;(2) হলে&nbsp;&fnof;(x) =&nbsp;x&sup3; - x -6 = 0 হবে।<br />x&sup3; - x -6<br />= x&sup2;(x - 2) + 2x(x-2) + 3(x-2)<br />= (x-2)(x&sup2; + 2x + 3)</p>"}, {"id": "11", "question": "১১) ax + b, a &ne; 0 হলে, রাশিটি কখন কোনো বহুপদী &fnof;(x) এর উৎপাদক হবে?", "option1": "ক) যদি এবং কেবল যদি &fnof;(-b/a) = 0 হয়", "option2": "খ) যদি এবং কেবল যদি &fnof;(-b/a) = 1 হয়", "option3": "গ) যদি এবং কেবল যদি &fnof;(b/a) = 0 হয়", "option4": "ঘ) যদি &fnof;(-b/a) = 0 হয়", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>ax + b, a &ne; 0 হলে, রাশিটি কখন কোনো বহুপদী &fnof;(x) এর উৎপাদক হবে যদি এবং কেবল যদি &fnof;(-b/a) = 0 হয়। অনুসিদ্ধান্ত ১৩; ৯-১০ম শ্রেণি।</p>"}, {"id": "12", "question": "১২) a&sup3; - 21a -20 রাশিটির একটি উৎপাদক হবে নিচের কোনটি?", "option1": "ক) (a + 2)", "option2": "খ) (a - 2)", "option3": "গ) (a + 1)", "option4": "ঘ) (a - 1)", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>a&sup3; - 21a -20<br />= a&sup3; + a&sup2; - a&sup2; - a - 20a - 20<br />= a&sup2;(a + 1) - a ( a + 1) - 20(a + 1)<br />= (a+1)(a&sup2; -a - 20)</p>"}, {"id": "13", "question": "১৩) a<sup>6</sup>/27 - b<sup>6</sup> এর উৎপাদক কি কি?", "option1": "ক) <img src='https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1937-13option1.png'/>", "option2": "খ) <img src='https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1937-13op2.png'/>", "option3": "গ) <img src='https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1937-13op3.png'/>", "option4": "ঘ) <img src='https://elasticbeanstalk-ap-southeast-1-051040323559.s3.amazonaws.com/livemcq-files/media/uploads/1937-13op4.png'/>", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>a<sup>6</sup>/27 - b<sup>6</sup><br />= (a&sup2;/3)&sup3; - (b&sup2;)&sup3;<br />= (a&sup2;/3 - b&sup2;)(a<sup>4</sup>/9 + (a&sup2;b&sup2;)/3 + b<sup>4</sup>)</p>"}, {"id": "14", "question": "১৪) 54x<sup>4</sup> + 24x&sup3;a - 16x - 8a এর একটি উৎপাদক (x-2) হলে a এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 4", "option2": "খ) 5", "option3": "গ) 4.5", "option4": "ঘ) -4.5", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>54x<sup>4</sup> + 24x&sup3;a - 16x - 8a এর একটি উৎপাদক (x-2) হলে x = 2<br />&there4; 54&times;(2)<sup>4</sup> + 24&times;(2)&sup3;a - 16&times;2 -8a = 0<br />&rArr; 832 + 184a = 0&nbsp;<br />&rArr; a = - 832/184 = -4.52</p>"}, {"id": "15", "question": "১৫) x<sup>4</sup> + x&sup2; - 20 এর উৎপাদক নয় কোনটি?", "option1": "ক) (x + 2)", "option2": "খ) (x + 1)", "option3": "গ) (x - 2)", "option4": "ঘ) (x&sup2; + 5)", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>.x<sup>4</sup> + x&sup2; - 20<br />= x4 + 5x&sup2; - 4x&sup2; - 20<br />= x&sup2;(x&sup2; + 5) - 4(x&sup2; + 5)<br />= (x&sup2; + 5)(x + 2)(x - 2)</p>"}, {"id": "16", "question": "১৬) 4(x&sup2; + ax)&sup2;, 6(x&sup3; -a&sup2;x) এবং 14x&sup3;(x&sup3; -a&sup3;) এর ল.সা.গু. কত?", "option1": "ক) 84x&sup3;(x + a)&sup2;(x&sup3; - a&sup3;)", "option2": "খ) 84x&sup3;(x + a)&sup2;", "option3": "গ) 84x(x&sup3; - a&sup3;)", "option4": "ঘ) 84(x + a)&sup2;(x&sup3; - a&sup3;)", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>১ম রাশি=4(x&sup2; + ax)&sup2;<br />= 2&times;2&times;x&sup2;(x + a)&sup2;<br />২য় রাশি= 6(x&sup3; -a&sup2;x)<br />= 2&times;3&times;x(x +a)(x - a)<br />৩য় রাশি = 14x&sup3;(x&sup3; -a&sup3;)<br />= 2&times;7&times;x&sup3;(x - a)(x&sup2; + ax + a&sup2;)<br />&there4;ল.সা.গু. = 84x&sup3;(x + a)&sup2;(x&sup3; - a&sup3;)</p>"}, {"id": "17", "question": "১৭) x&sup3; - 8(x - y)&sup3; এর উৎপাদক কোনটি?", "option1": "ক) (-x + y)(7x&sup2; - 10xy + 4y&sup2;)", "option2": "খ) (-x + 2y)(7x<sup>4</sup> - 10xy + 4y<sup>4</sup>)", "option3": "গ) (-x + 2y)(7x&sup2; - 10xy + 4y&sup2;)", "option4": "ঘ) (x - 2y)(7x&sup2; - 10xy + 4y&sup2;)", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>x&sup3; - 8(x - y)&sup3;<br />= x&sup3; - (2x - 2y)&sup3;<br />= (x - 2x + 2y){(x&sup2; + x(2x - 2y) + (2x&nbsp;- 2y)&sup2;}<br />= (-x + 2y)(x<sup>2</sup> + 2x<sup>2</sup> - 2xy + 4x<sup>2</sup> - 8xy + 4y<sup>2</sup>)<br />= (-x + 2y)(7x&sup2; - 10xy + 4y&sup2;)</p>"}, {"id": "18", "question": "১৮) p<sup>6</sup> - q<sup>6</sup> এর উৎপাদক সমূহ কোনটি?", "option1": "ক) (p&sup2; - pq + q&sup2;)(p&sup2; + pq + q&sup2;)", "option2": "খ) (p + q)(p -q)", "option3": "গ) (p + q)(p -q)(p<sup>4</sup> - pq + q<sup>4</sup>)(p<sup>4</sup> + pq + q<sup>4</sup>)", "option4": "ঘ) (p + q)(p -q)(p&sup2; - pq + q&sup2;)(p&sup2; + pq + q&sup2;)", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>p<sup>6</sup> - q<sup>6</sup>&nbsp;<br />= (p&sup3;)&sup2; -(q&sup3;)&sup2;<br />= (p&sup3; + q&sup3;)(p&sup3; - q&sup3;)<br />= (p + q)(p -q)(p&sup2; - pq + q&sup2;)(p&sup2; + pq + q&sup2;)</p>"}, {"id": "19", "question": "১৯) &fnof;(1) = a&sup3; - 9 + (a + 1)&sup3; এর মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 1", "option2": "খ) 2", "option3": "গ) 0", "option4": "ঘ) 8", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>&fnof;(1) = a&sup3; - 9 + (a + 1)&sup3;<br />= (1)&sup3; - 9 + (2)&sup3;<br />= 1 - 9 + 8<br />= 0</p>"}, {"id": "20", "question": "২০) x<sup>4</sup> + 6x&sup2; - 7 এর উৎপাদক নয় কোনটি?", "option1": "ক) (x&sup2; + 7)", "option2": "খ) (x + 1)", "option3": "গ) (x - 1)", "option4": "ঘ) (x + 2)", "answer": "4", "exp": "<p>x<sup>4</sup> + 6x&sup2; - 7<br />= (x&sup2;)&sup2; + 2.x&sup2;.3 + 3&sup2; - 16<br />= (x&sup2; + 3)&sup2; - 4&sup2;<br />= (x&sup2; + 3 + 4)(x&sup2; + 3 - 4)<br />= (x&sup2; + 7)(x&sup2; - 1)<br />= (x&sup2; + 7)(x + 1)(x - 1)</p>"}, {"id": "21", "question": "২১) 18(x +y)&sup3;, 24(x + y)&sup2; এবং 32(x&sup2; - y&sup2;) এর গ.সা.গু. কত?", "option1": "ক) 2", "option2": "খ) (x + y)", "option3": "গ) 2(x + y)", "option4": "ঘ) 2(x - y)", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>১ম রাশি = 18(x + y)&sup3;<br />= 2.3.3(x + y)(x + y)(x + y)<br />২য় রাশি =24(x + y)&sup2;<br />= 2.2.2.3(x + y)(x + y)<br />৩য় রাশি = 32(x&sup2; - y&sup2;)<br />= 2.2.2.2.2(x + y)(x - y)<br />&there4; গ.সা.গু. = 2(x + y)</p>"}, {"id": "22", "question": "২২) a³ - 6a² + 12a - 9 এর উৎপাদক সমূহ কোনটি?", "option1": "ক) (a - 3)(a³ - 3a + 3)", "option2": "খ) (a² - 3a + 3)", "option3": "গ) (a - 3)(a² - 3a + 3)", "option4": "ঘ) (a + 3)(a² - 3a + 3)", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>a³ - 6a² + 12a - 9<br>= a³ - 6a² + 12a - 8 - 1<br>= (a - 2)³ - (1)³<br>= (a - 2 -1){(a - 2)² + (a - 2).1 + (1)²}<br>=(a - 3)(a² - 3a + 3)</p>"}, {"id": "23", "question": "২৩) 8x&sup3; + 36x&sup2;y + 54xy&sup2; + 27y&sup3; রাশি এর উৎপাদক কি কি?", "option1": "ক) (x + 3y)&sup3;", "option2": "খ) (2x + 3y)&sup3;", "option3": "গ) (2x + 3)&sup3;", "option4": "ঘ) (2x + 3y)&sup3;(x - 1)", "answer": "2", "exp": "<p>8x&sup3; + 36x&sup2;y + 54xy&sup2; + 27y&sup3;<br />=(2x)&sup3; + 3.(2x)&sup2;.3y + 3.2x.(3y)&sup2; + (3y)&sup3;<br />=(2x + 3y)&sup3;</p>"}, {"id": "24", "question": "২৪) a&sup2; - 4a + 3 = 0 হলে a মান কত?", "option1": "ক) 3", "option2": "খ) -3", "option3": "গ) 1 ও 3", "option4": "ঘ) কোনটি নয়", "answer": "3", "exp": "<p>a&sup2; - 4a + 3 = 0<br />&rArr; a&sup2; - 3a -a + 3 = 0<br />&rArr; a(a - 3) -1(a - 3) = 0<br />&rArr; (a - 3)(a - 1) = 0<br />&rArr; a = 3; a = 1</p>"}, {"id": "25", "question": "২৫) a³ + b³, (a + b)³ এবং (a² - b²)² এর ল.সা.গু. কত?", "option1": "ক) (a + b)³(a - b)<sup>²</sup>(a² - ab + b²)", "option2": "খ) (a + b)(a - b)(a² - ab + b²)", "option3": "গ) (a + b)³(a - b)(a² + ab + b²)", "option4": "ঘ) (a + b)²(a - b)(a² - ab + b²)", "answer": "1", "exp": "<p>২৫) a³ + b³, (a + b)³ এবং (a² - b²)² এর ল.সা.গু. কত?</p>\r\n<p>১ম রাশি = a³ + b³<br>= (a + b)(a² - ab + b²)<br><br>২য় রাশি = (a + b)³<br>= (a + b)(a + b)(a + b)<br><br>৩য় রাশি = (a² - b²)²<br>= (a + b )(a - b)(a + b)(a - b)<br><br>∴ ল.সা.গু. = (a + b)³(a - b)<sup>2</sup>(a² - ab + b²)</p>\r\n<p></p>", "is_audio": true, "question_duration": "00:15", "answer_duration": "00:09", "explain_duration": "00:59"}]}, "exam_time": 1500000, "pk": 1937, "is_omr": false, "omr_time": 7200000, "is_mapping": false, "question_mapping": {}, "_source": "exam-view", "_exam_id": 1937}